Package: voov-meeting
Version: @VERSION@
Section: net
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Installed-Size: @INSTALLED_SIZE@
Depends: wine | wine64, desktop-file-utils
Recommends: xdg-utils, libnotify-bin
Suggests: pipewire
Maintainer: Homin Luo <homin.ro@gmail.com>
Homepage: https://github.com/hominluo/voov-meeting-linux
Description: VooV Meeting (unofficial Linux build)
 VooV Meeting is Tencent's international video-conferencing client.
 .
 Tencent does not ship a Linux client, so this package runs the official
 VooV Meeting @APP_VERSION@ for Windows under Wine and adds native Linux
 desktop integration. The client is installed read-only under /opt and
 copied into a per-user Wine prefix on first start.
 .
 This is an unofficial community build. The bundled application is
 proprietary Tencent software; only the packaging and helper scripts are
 MIT licensed.
